    {
      "id": "09ed536e-054b-4bfb-b50e-e4c5e51856b3",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1296,
        -608
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 672,
        "height": 976,
        "content": "## New Listing Social Media Post Generator\n\nGenerates ready-to-post social media content for every new listing — four platforms in one click.\n\n### How it works\nAgent submits listing details via Google Form.  AI generates platform-specific posts for Instagram,  Facebook, LinkedIn, and X — each tailored to the target buyer profile. All four posts arrive in a formatted email within 30 seconds, ready to copy-paste. Everything logs to Google Sheets. Optionally posts directly to Facebook and Instagram \nvia Meta Graph API.\n\n### Requirements\n- **Gmail** OAuth2\n- **Gemini** API key\n- **Google Sheets** OAuth2\n- **Facebook Graph API** — optional, for direct posting\n\n### Setup\n1. Create the Google Form using the field list in the trigger node sticky note.\n2. Link the form to a Google Sheet and connect the Sheets Trigger to that sheet.\n3. Copy the Social Post History sheet template and link it to the Log node.\n4. Update AGENT_NAME and AGENT_EMAIL in the Configuration node.\n5. Set POST_TO_FACEBOOK and POST_TO_INSTAGRAM to true and fill in your Meta credentials to enable direct posting (optional).\n\n### Customization\n- Edit the Gemini prompt to adjust tone per platform.\n- Add a new platform by adding a field to the prompt and mapping it in the Parse AI Output node.\n- Translate all posts to another language by adding a language instruction to the Gemini prompt."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "cf9bd8bf-bb0a-42be-8744-4d374ebb1f35",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -480,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#FAFAFA",
        "width": 336,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## How Listings Enter This Workflow\nGoogle Form is the default trigger. Agent fills in listing details and submits. Webhook is optional for connecting any external system or CRM. Create your Google Form using the field list provided in the submission docs."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4fc9256f-c047-4a1a-8c0d-26a5e1f8885c",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -112,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#FAFAFA",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## Extraction & Configuration\nExract listing details and configure settings, agent name, email, and optional Meta posting credentials. Set POST_TO_FACEBOOK and POST_TO_INSTAGRAM to true only after adding your Meta Page Access Token, Page ID, and Instagram Account ID."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d3acf38e-761a-4e5a-89c7-f8321e79f012",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        304,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#FAFAFA",
        "width": 528,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## AI Post Generation\nGemini generates platform-specific posts for Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, and X simultaneously. Each post adapts tone based on the target buyer — investor posts are data-driven, family posts are warm and neighbourhood-focused, luxury posts are sophisticated and understated."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1daba66a-23d1-4dea-845a-a0a5ff4e5ad9",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        864,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#FAFAFA",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## Email & Logging\nAll four posts arrive in one formatted email — \neach platform clearly separated with its hashtags.\nIncludes a suggested image caption for use \nacross any platform. Every generated post set logs to Google Sheets with the listing details, all four posts, and direct posting status for Facebook and Instagram."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "214dbab8-5a4b-4bac-8ae1-12b550c2b63f",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1296,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#FAFAFA",
        "width": 944,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## Direct Social Posting (Optional)\nFacebook and Instagram posting nodes are on canvas but disconnected by default. Fill in Meta credentials in the Configuration node and set posting toggles to true to enable. Instagram requires a publicly accessible image URL in the form submission to post directly."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "78d8f411-1b45-4892-9765-0490dbf46a9d",
      "name": "Sticky Note6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1728,
        16
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 224,
        "height": 528,
        "content": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n## Instagram Requires an Image URL\nInstagram API cannot post without an image. The agent must provide a publicly accessible property image URL in the Google Form. If no image URL is provided this node is skipped."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7ae043b0-a601-40b1-90b9-c18b4645f425",
      "name": "Sticky Note7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        80,
        -96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 208,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n## Update Before Using\nSet AGENT_NAME and AGENT_EMAIL before activating. For direct posting also set FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID, \nMETA_ACCESS_TOKEN, and INSTAGRAM_ACCOUNT_ID. Meta Page Access Tokens expire in 1-2 hours — use a System User token for permanent access."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
